sequenceDiagram
    participant UDFRunner
    participant DB

    Note over UDFRunner,DB: Nested calls opened by UDFRunner while a parent DB-opened call remains active

    UDFRunner->>DB: CallOpen(get_connection, {connection_name})
    DB-->>UDFRunner: Payloads(connection_information, ...)
    UDFRunner->>DB: CloseCall

    UDFRunner->>DB: CallOpen(get_script, {script_name})
    DB-->>UDFRunner: Payloads(script, ...) + CloseCall

    UDFRunner->>DB: CallOpen(execute_query, {query})
    DB-->>UDFRunner: Payloads(result_set_status, ...)
    DB-->>UDFRunner: DataMetaData + RecordBatch(...) on the call's data stream
    UDFRunner->>DB: CloseCall
